WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:04.203 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: This may look
like a decorative dog standing

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:09.409 line:0%
amid five Halloween
decoration cats,

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:13.679 line:0%
but the dog is real, a Lab
by the name of Maverick.

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.381 line:0%
ADAM FLORES: He was
just like, frozen.

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:18.117 line:0%
I mean, it's like somebody
just like, frozen in place.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.219 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: Maverick's
owner, Adam Flores,

00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:23.589 line:0%
says it was the first
time the dog saw the cats.

00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:25.124 line:0%
He stopped in his tracks--

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:27.460 line:0%
[LAUGHING]

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:31.064 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: --in their South
Texas front yard as Adam,

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:34.834 line:0%
his wife, and even his
5-year-old daughter cracked up.

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:35.635 line:0%
ADAM FLORES: Maverick

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.004 line:0%
[LAUGHING]

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.039
JEANNE MOOS: He looks
like you paused him,

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:41.741
commented one TikToker.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:44.777
Joked another, I think
your dog is broken.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:49.882
To do a hard reset,
refer to owner's manual.

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:52.552
ADAM FLORES: Hey come on, Mav.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.720
JEANNE MOOS: It was as
if Maverick was trapped

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:56.756
in that old Gloria Gaynor song.

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:58.791 line:0%
[MUSIC - GLORIA GAYNOR, "I WILL
SURVIVE"] At first I afraid,

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:00.693 line:0%
I was petrified

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:03.963 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: And only after
more than a minute of paralysis

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:06.732 line:0%
did Adam manage to
break the spell.

00:01:06.765 --> 00:01:07.567 line:0%
ADAM FLORES: Hey.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.801 line:0%
It's OK, dude.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:12.205 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: His catatonic
tail woke up first.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:15.875 line:0%
Someone pointed out, Lab
thinks he's a pointer.

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:18.811 line:0%
So we showed the
video to Justin McGill

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:23.216 line:0%
who breeds Pointing Labs at
Hunters Point Kennel in Iowa.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:26.919
Was Maverick pointing,
or was he petrified?

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:28.354 line:0%
JUSTIN MCGILL: Oh no,
hell he was pointing.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:29.689 line:0%
He wasn't scared.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.757 line:0%
His body language,
his tail was medium.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.593 line:0%
He wasn't tucked
between his legs.

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.394
He didn't have any
control over that,

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:37.063
that's just total instinct.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:39.365
He walked out the door,
saw that and locked up.

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:43.236
JEANNE MOOS: Unlike
an English Pointer,

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:47.773
Labs are not known as pretty
pointers when they spot prey.

00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:49.442
JUSTIN MCGILL: Oh,
yeah, it's ugly as hell.

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:51.978
JEANNE MOOS: Nevertheless--
what do you say to people

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:54.080
that say labs don't point?

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:55.915
JUSTIN MCGILL: [MUTED]
Come up and see my kennel.

00:01:55.948 --> 00:02:00.019 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: The point is, don't
call Maverick a scaredy cat.

00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:02.021 line:0%
Jeanne Moos, CNN.

00:02:02.054 --> 00:02:03.456 line:0%
ADAM FLORES: It's OK, dude.

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.358 line:0%
JEANNE MOOS: New York

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:06.993 line:0%
ADAM FLORES: Come on.

